  "description": "Framework-agnostic core for fluent log assertions over Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Testing.FakeLogCollector. Provides ILogRecordFilter + LogFilter composable filter primitives, the failure-message rendering, the FakeLogCollector inspection extensions (Filter, CountMatching, DumpTo), event-driven waits for background logs (WaitForLogAsync, WaitForLogsAsync on FakeLogCollector.GetLogsAsync), and the LogCollectorBuilder factories (Create, CreateDiscarding). Test-framework-specific entry points live in adapter packages (LogAssertions.TUnit ships today; xUnit, NUnit, MSTest adapters are possible if there is demand).",
  "id": "LogAssertions",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-02T18:24:02.217Z",
